<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>박현빈 관심사</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="hobby-body">

        <h1>관심사</h1>

        <div class="hobby-container">

            <div class="hobby-item">
                <a href="/grit">
                    <div class="hobby-circle">
                        <img src="/images/grit.jpg" alt="GRIT 601">
                        <h2>GRIT 601</h2>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <p>밴드 GRIT601에서 건반을 맡고 있습니다.</p>
            </div>


            <div class="hobby-item">
                <a href="/jji">
                    <div class="hobby-circle">
                        <img src="/images/jji1.jpg" alt="정준일">
                        <h2>정준일</h2>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <p>가장 좋아하는 발라드 가수 정준일입니다.</p>
            </div>


            <div class="hobby-item">
                <a href="/nell">
                    <div class="hobby-circle">
                        <img src="/images/nell.jpg" alt="NELL">
                        <h2>NELL</h2>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <p>가장 좋아하는 밴드 NELL입니다.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>